class: negative
summary: an `inout` field of a binding is refused while a binding views another field of it, and the note says that the view holds the whole binding because fields are not tracked apart
program: program.ldn
args: ../tests/fixtures/negative/inout-field-beside-a-view-of-its-binding/program.ldn
expect: expected.txt
codes: L0315
constructs: 0800, 0830
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
status: 1
